ory":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"disaster_prevention-int-1","name":"针对35处滑坡隐患点，实施削坡减载与挡土墙工程，清除坡体上部松散土体，降低滑坡推力，在坡脚设置重力式或衡重式挡土墙进行支挡。针对5处崩塌隐患点，采用主动防护网与锚固工程，清除危岩体，对不稳定岩体施加预应力锚杆加固，并铺设柔性防护网拦截落石。在40处地灾隐患点周边及金田河沿岸生态缓冲带，全面布设截排水沟系统，总长度约5000m（待 GIS 校核），防止地表水下渗诱发地质灾害。拓宽16km村道至8m标准，确保路面宽度满足消防车通道不小于4m的规范要求，清理道路上空障碍物，保障路面与障碍物之间净高不小于4m，打通消防与救援生命通道。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"heritage-int-0","name":"祠堂活化在满足祭祀与传统活动需求基础上，改造为小书屋、自习室与村民文化活动中心，植入非遗展示与研学功能。古树名木实行挂牌保护与定期检查，千年古檀树与五百年蕈树周边规划为主题公园，设立解说系统介绍历史文化价值与伯公树信仰。传统文化习俗活化推举乡贤主持添灯与公王仪式，鼓励手艺人申请非物质文化遗产代表性项目，改造闲置传统民居为文化展示基地，策划古驿道徒步与船灯舞体验活动吸引游客参与。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"heritage-int-1","name":"文化遗产保护区域配套建设标准化消防设施，在社前村、黄竹村、田坑村祠堂及炉池村古驿道节点增设室外消火栓与灭火器箱。安装全覆盖高清视频监控系统，实现文物建筑与古树名木区域24小时安防监控。在炉池村古驿道入口设置游客服务中心，提供咨询、寄存与医疗救助服务。完善标识系统，设立中英双语历史文化解说牌、古驿道导览图与非遗展示标识，统一采用客家传统风格设计。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"heritage-int-2","name":"核心保护区内严格控制常住人口规模，规划期末常住人口控制在731人，引导部分人口向村庄建设区集中。限制核心保护区内新增建设用地，村庄建设用地规模控制在31.5公顷。核心保护区内禁止新建、扩建工业项目，严禁破坏传统风貌的现代化建设。建设控制地带内新建建筑需严格审批，确保建筑体量、高度与色彩与历史环境相协调。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-0","name":"基于金田村90%林地覆盖率与南粤古驿道遗存的资源禀赋，确立“林下经济+古驿文旅”双轮驱动的总体逻辑。选择林下灵芝种植与水稻烤烟轮作作为一产主导，依托1867.38公顷商业林拓展林下经济，利用85.2公顷耕地保障粮油与特色经济作物稳产。通过强链、补链、拓链策略形成合力：强链聚焦灵芝与杉木家具的深加工与文创化，补链完善古驿道研学与非遗展示服务设施，拓链延伸农旅融合与康养休闲业态，将生态与文化资源优势转化为产业经济优势。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-1","name":"一核：园寨非遗文旅与综合服务核，依托客家祠堂与千年古檀树，打造文化展示与游客集散中心。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-2","name":"一带：金田河生态与古驿道文旅串联带，沿金田河与南粤古驿道遗存，布局生态观光与研学体验功能。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-3","name":"三区：林下经济特色产业区（商业林区）、高效粮油轮作示范区（水田集中区）、生态保育与水源涵养区（生态林区）。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-4","name":"产研基地（研发顶层）：灵芝良种培育与林下生态种植技术科研转化，职业农民与非遗传承人培养。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-5","name":"第一产业（生产）：灵芝林下种植、水稻与烤烟轮作、杉木商业林抚育，产品流向第二产业。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-6","name":"第二产业（加工）：灵芝烘干与切片加工、杉木文创家具制造、烤烟初加工，展示与销售流向第三产业。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-7","name":"第三产业（展销/农旅融合）：古驿道研学旅游、非遗民俗体验、特色农林产品展销，三大板块互相支撑。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-8","name":"第一产业项目：","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-9","name":"1. 林下灵芝标准化种植示范基地：建设灵芝大棚与林下仿野生种植区，配套滴灌与遮阴设施，规模100亩，位于村中部商业林区。","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-10","name":"第二产业项目：","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{"area_range_ha":null,"category":"project","constraints":[],"derives_from_strategy":"特色保护类","evidence_refs":[],"functions":[],"implementation_phase":"short","intervention_id":"industry-int-11","name":"第三产业项目：","problem_addressed":"","scale":"","service_population":null,"spatial_requirements":{}},{